# AI Lead Management Platform — Implementation Plan

## 1. Product Goal

Build a customizable AI-powered lead-management platform for businesses that already receive leads.

This is NOT a traditional generic CRM.

Each business should receive a tailored integration based on:

* Where its leads come from
* What information matters for that business
* How leads should be qualified
* How leads should be prioritized
* What actions should happen automatically
* What systems the business already uses
* How sales employees currently work

The core platform should remain reusable, while business-specific logic should be implemented through adapters, configuration, custom fields, rules, and AI workflows.

Example:

```text
Website
WhatsApp
Facebook Ads
Instagram
Email
Phone
Existing CRM
       ↓
Business-specific adapters
       ↓
Lead ingestion layer
       ↓
Normalized internal lead format
       ↓
PostgreSQL
       ↓
AI lead analysis
       ↓
Lead scoring / qualification
       ↓
Recommended actions
       ↓
Automation layer
       ↓
Salesperson / CRM / WhatsApp / Email
```

