# 10. AI Lead Analysis

Create structured AI responses.

Never rely on free-text responses when structured output is possible.

Use Pydantic models.

Example:

```python
class LeadAnalysis(BaseModel):
    score: int
    priority: Literal["low", "medium", "high", "critical"]
    sentiment: Literal["negative", "neutral", "positive"]
    summary: str
    recommended_action: str
    reasoning: list[str]
    missing_information: list[str]
```

The AI should receive:

```text
Business description
Business scoring rules
Lead information
Lead custom fields
Activity history
Previous AI analysis
```

It should output structured analysis.

