# 11. AI Scoring

Do NOT make lead scoring completely dependent on an LLM.

Create two layers.

## Deterministic scoring

Examples:

```text
Budget known          +15
Buying timeframe <30d +20
Replied                +10
Requested pricing      +15
Proposal requested     +20
No contact >7 days     -10
Repeated no response   -20
```

## AI scoring

AI evaluates subjective factors:

```text
intent
sentiment
buying signals
fit
urgency
conversation quality
```

Combine the scores.

Example:

```text
final_score =
    deterministic_score * 0.6
    + ai_score * 0.4
```

Make weights configurable per business.

