# 23. Future Automation Engine

Design the architecture so we can later support rules like:

```text
WHEN:
lead.score > 85

AND:
lead.status == "new"

THEN:
notify salesperson
send WhatsApp
create task
```

Another example:

```text
WHEN:
proposal_sent == true

AND:
no_response_for > 3 days

THEN:
generate personalized follow-up
```

Do not fully implement this in MVP, but avoid architecture decisions that make it difficult later.

