# 25. Safety / AI Guardrails

AI must never directly modify critical data without controlled application logic.

The LLM may propose:

```text
recommended_action = "send_followup"
```

Application code decides whether the action can actually happen.

Use:

```text
LLM = reasoning
Application = authority
Database = source of truth
```

Never treat the LLM as the database.

